 `A` against `rabinBlumTrapdoor` is at most twice the Blum factoring probability of `A'`
@@ -3230,7 +3399,25 @@ theorem rabinBlumTrapdoor_invProbAt_le (H : ArithmeticFP) (hD : BlumDensity) (A
